## Detailed User Stories & Acceptance Criteria

### User Story 1: User Login (Epic 5)
* **As a** Registered User (Student/Faculty/Admin),
* **I want to** log in with my username and password,
* **So that** I can access feature sets tailored to my role securely[span_40](start_span)[span_40](end_span).

**Acceptance Criteria:**
1. Login page loads successfully[span_41](start_span)[span_41](end_span).
2. Registered users can log in with valid credentials[span_42](start_span)[span_42](end_span).
3. Invalid credentials display an appropriate error message[span_43](start_span)[span_43](end_span).
4. Successful login redirects the user to their designated dashboard[span_44](start_span)[span_44](end_span).
5. Session management maintains active authentication securely[span_45](start_span)[span_45](end_span).

### User Story 2: Record Attendance (Epic 3)
* **As a** Faculty Member,
* **I want to** select my course and record daily student attendance,
* **So that** attendance records remain accurate and up to date[span_46](start_span)[span_46](end_span).

**Acceptance Criteria:**
1. Faculty can select a specific registered course[span_47](start_span)[span_47](end_span).
2. Faculty can select the lecture date[span_48](start_span)[span_48](end_span).
3. Faculty can mark each student as Present or Absent[span_49](start_span)[span_49](end_span).
4. Attendance records are saved to the database successfully[span_50](start_span)[span_50](end_span).
5. Summary attendance reports update immediately[span_51](start_span)[span_51](end_span).

### User Story 3: Student Registration (Epic 1)
* **As an** Administrator,
* **I want to** register a new student with personal and academic details,
* **So that** their profile is active in the institutional system[span_52](start_span)[span_52](end_span).

**Acceptance Criteria:**
1. Admin can input student personal details, enrollment number, and assigned department[span_53](start_span)[span_53](end_span).
2. System validates mandatory fields and checks for duplicate entries[span_54](start_span)[span_54](end_span).
3. Confirmation message displays upon successful registration[span_55](start_span)[span_55](end_span).
